      "x": 95,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 78,
      "text": "Recovery transitions (not drawn \u2014 kept off-canvas to avoid clutter):\n  takeover  \u2192  takeover_pending       (takeover lease timeout, then chains into pending timeout)\n  takeover_pending  \u2192  completed       (pending timeout)\n  completed / timed_out  \u2192  takeover_pending       (reopen, within feature_takeover_reopen_window_seconds)",
      "originalText": "Recovery transitions (not drawn \u2014 kept off-canvas to avoid clutter):\n  takeover  \u2192  takeover_pending       (takeover lease timeout, then chains into pending timeout)\n  takeover_pending  \u2192  completed       (pending timeout)\n  completed / timed_out  \u2192  takeover_pending       (reopen, within feature_takeover_reopen_window_seconds)",
